// name :
"P216139930" "The Great Grun Gathering"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TeleAmp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2757403801" "Telempathic Amplifier"
// DetailString :
"P2504729675" "A Telempathic Amplifier is a device which can boost the inherent ability of a user to broadcast basic emotions. They are designed to be used as weapons, but rarely see deployment, because if your telepath has a mood swing or is upset with a superior officer, it can spell disaster for friendly troops caught in the area of effect. Still, many groups like to keep one of these devices around, just in case."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DispersalDevice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4126435902" "Bioweapon Dispersal Device"
// DetailString :
"P1930117288" "This device is built to gently but very effectively disperse a bio-warfare agent into the atmosphere. You have to wonder what Vernon von Grun needs this for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheWill 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1777947595" "A dangerous sample"
// DetailString :
"P60007346" "You took these refrigerated impact-proof containers of strange burbling purple fluid from a Longbow base. This stuff is the Will of the Earth, a telepathic semi-intelligent bacterial sludge that turns rocks, trees, and even people into the monstrous creatures of the Devouring Earth. Whatever Vernon von Grun is planning to do with this stuff, it can't be good. <br><br>Even chilled to dormancy, you can still feel faint telepathic feelings emanating from this stuff."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3406331224" "The Great Grun Gathering"
// DetailString :
"P1139741413" "Now that Vernon von Grun's basic research was completed thanks to all the samples of Devouring Earth creatures you'd brought him, he told you he was ready for the next big step. After a moderate amount of ranting, Vernon told you that he'd need several pieces that he couldn't build himself for whatever it is he's planning. You were able to help get the first piece he'd need: A 'Telempathic Amplifier' you stole from the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3015056550" "Now that Vernon von Grun's basic research was completed thanks to all the samples of Devouring Earth creatures you'd brought him, he told you he was ready for the next big step. After a moderate amount of ranting, Vernon told you that he'd need several pieces that he couldn't build himself for whatever it is he's planning. You were able to help get the first piece he'd need: A 'Telempathic Amplifier' you stole from the Council. <br><br>The next item Vernon needed was a bio-weapon dispersal device used for spreading out a bio-warfare agent. It took a lot of convoluted work, but in the end you managed to get one out from under the nose of the Malta group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL9_GV_VonGrun_MiniArc2_SouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P761856836" "A hermetically sealed capsule"
// tDetailString :
"P1458660042" "This hermetically sealed capsule once held a sample of the dangerous telepathic semi-intelligent mutagenic bacteria known as 'The Will of the Earth'. You stole it from Longbow for Vernon von Grun in an escapade you remember as: <br><br>The Great Grun Gathering <br><br>You'd worked with Vernon von Grun before, helping him complete his basic research on the Devouring Earth, and was ready for the next big step. Vernon told you that he'd need several pieces that he couldn't build himself for whatever it is he's planning. You were able to help get the first piece he'd need: A 'Telempathic Amplifier' you stole from the Council. <br><br>The next item Vernon needed was a bio-weapon dispersal device used for spreading out a bio-warfare agent. It took a lot of convoluted work, but in the end you managed to get one out from under the nose of the Malta group. <br><br>The last piece was a sample of the Will of the Earth mutagenic bacteria that was sealed off under Longbow guard. You still got the sample out of their base and back to Vernon. While he took the sample itself for his own mad schemes, he had no problem with you keeping the container it came in as a memento."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1880471287" "Now that my basic research is complete, the next step is technological application. The design and assembly of all the pieces of the apparatus I need is sadly beyond my skills. It pains me to admit it, but part of science is to gaze unflinchingly at truth. I am not a great engineer, but I am capable enough to know where to find the pieces I need. And that, my friend, is where you can help me once more. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are you ready, {VillainName}? Are you ready to wreak the terrible will of Science?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P708173954" "Gather components for Vernon von Grun"
// SendOffString :
"P1099715448" "Excellent! You are a true friend of science, {VillainName}. Now then, the first item I will need is a telempathic amplifier. Operative Grillo requested the one I was planning to use, curse him! But I did find out that the Council has been working on a similar device. They most likely have it in a hidden compound, and I want you to get it for me. Nothing else there matters, but if you wish to conduct some experiments in mayhem yourself while you're there, be my guest. In fact, here, take this! It's but the first fruit of my newfound understanding of the Devouring Earth! These insectoid predators have been modified to lay dormant until you throw them at an enemy. And they've even been tuned so that they have almost no chance of attacking you!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1217405858" "Steal device from Council"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3163152367" "Once you have the telempathic amplifier from the Council, bring it back to me. It's only the first step, but it will be a very important first step."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2946934439" "You're surprised to see a Council base down here. You wonder if Arachnos doesn't know about it, or just allows it to exist?"

